"outputs/a5d43b4c-c538-4f34-8cf3-92c2c0d26fdd-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "For loop {#for-loop}"
msgstr "حلقة For {#for-loop}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A for loop is used to iterate over a sequence of classical values and "
"perform some operations during each iteration.\n"
msgstr ""
"تُستخدم حلقة for للتكرار عبر تسلسل من القيم الكلاسيكية وتنفيذ بعض العمليات "
"في كل تكرار.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following example uses a for loop to apply 5 X gates to a qubit and then"
" measures it. Because it performs an odd number of X gates, the overall "
"effect is to flip the qubit from the 0 state to the 1 state.\n"
msgstr ""
"يستخدم المثال التالي حلقة for لتطبيق 5 بوابات X على qubit ثم يقيسه. ونظراً "
"لتنفيذ عدد فردي من بوابات X، يكون التأثير الإجمالي هو قلب الـ qubit من "
"الحالة 0 إلى الحالة 1.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/classical-"
"feedforward-and-control-flow/extracted-"
"outputs/53a26ce5-3564-47a0-8803-c9c46db86923-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/classical-"
"feedforward-and-control-flow/extracted-"
"outputs/53a26ce5-3564-47a0-8803-c9c46db86923-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "While loop {#while-loop}"
msgstr "حلقة While {#while-loop}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A while loop is used to repeat instructions while some condition is "
"satisfied.\n"
msgstr "تُستخدم حلقة while لتكرار التعليمات طالما تحقق شرط معين.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The example below applies Hadamard gates to two qubits and measures them. "
"Then it creates a while loop that repeats this procedure while the "
"measurement outcome is 11. As a result, the final measurement should never "
"be 11, with the remaining possibilities appearing with approximately equal "
"frequency.\n"
msgstr ""
"يطبّق المثال التالي بوابات هادامار على Qubitين ويقيسهما. ثم ينشئ حلقة while "
"تكرر هذا الإجراء ما دامت نتيجة القياس 11. ونتيجةً لذلك، يجب ألا تكون نتيجة "
"القياس النهائية 11 أبداً، مع ظهور الاحتمالات المتبقية بتكرار متقارب.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/classical-"
"feedforward-and-control-flow/extracted-"
"outputs/174a9675-3c8b-4b5e-808e-f7e0f8b9c805-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/classical-"
